Derek Zahn (in replying to Eric Raymond) wrote:

[considerable deleted]

>So I ask a question to the Body Extropian:  Is it appropriate
>and desirable for us to discuss, in this forum, details of
>practices (by which I mean concrete details, not underlying
>assertions about faeries or yogis) that lead us personally
>to astonishing experiences?  Whether such accounts are boring
